     1,
     "This is something that was changed in 2.0.0. <br><br>The current docs are not quite up to date either. <br><br><a href=\"http://docs.ggplot2.org/dev/stat_summary.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.ggplot2.org/dev/stat_summary.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368230646000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3lVACI50OZMvyyXhCdoPQc\">http://docs.ggplot2.org/dev/stat_summary.html</a><br><br>In the dev docs it show an example though. You need to wrap your input for the function in a list and pass them through with fun.args. <br><br>HTH<br><br>B<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
